<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\宴会.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\居酒屋2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE> has really become the star girl around here."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Cho-san, speaking of star girls, remember that girl?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Who?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You know, from that place called whatsit..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That doesn't tell me anything."<PG>
"That one, that one! At the cafe."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, the cafe across from the cram school?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, yeah, that one!
{PAUSE ""}
　Up until a few years ago, there was an amazing waitress there, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I remember, I remember!
{PAUSE ""}
　The legendary star girl... Her name was..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What was it now... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hey, Boss, do you know? The legendary star girl who worked at the cafe."<PG>
―I believe that's <STYLE ID="2">Momoko Goto-san</STYLE> from Primavera. 
{PAUSE ""}
I heard she quit suddenly about 2 years ago and left Motoki-cho altogether.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's it! <STYLE ID="2">Momoko Goto</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The waitresses there now aren't bad either. <STYLE ID="2">She</STYLE> was just too amazing."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Beautiful, a nice bod, polite, attentive... 
{PAUSE ""}
It was like the word 'flawless' was made for <STYLE ID="2">that girl</STYLE>."<PG>
"Boss, you'd want a star girl like <STYLE ID="2">Momoko Goto</STYLE> too, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Hahaha, we've got <STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE> here. 
{PAUSE ""}
As long as <STYLE ID="1">she</STYLE> is here, we're fine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE>, huh. 
{PAUSE ""}
That's right, she forgives my sexual harassment."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's your reason?"<PG>
―I went to Primavera a few times myself, and I do think <STYLE ID="2">Momoko Goto-san</STYLE> was an excellent waitress. 
{PAUSE ""}
But, how should I put it... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She</STYLE> didn't seem to enjoy her work very much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You think so?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, she wasn't the type to go out of her way to chat with customers like <STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE> does. 
{PAUSE ""}
But it's a cafe, that's just how it is, isn't it?"<PG>
―<STYLE ID="2">Momoko Goto-san</STYLE> seemed to me to be looking a little too far ahead. 
{PAUSE ""}
How to get customers to like her, raise her pay, and reach the goal she had her sights set on―
{PAUSE ""}
that's what she seemed to be working for. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She</STYLE> probably vanished so suddenly because she had reached that goal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Leave it to you, Boss. You've got a sharp eye."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Now that you mention it, I never had a clue what <STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE> true self was like. 
{PAUSE ""}
So she was putting on an act after all?"<PG>
―It's odd for me to say this to customers, but customers come to a shop to enjoy the present. 
{PAUSE ""}
To get on the same wavelength as the customers as staff, I think what matters is whether your eyes are on the present. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE>, for all sorts of reasons, is living the present to the fullest. 
{PAUSE ""}
That's why there's nothing fake about <STYLE ID="1">her</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
Being able to see her true self as a person is where I think she's a match for <STYLE ID="2">Momoko Goto-san</STYLE>.<PG>
"Ohh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Boss, you sure think highly of <STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Of course. Since <STYLE ID="1">she</STYLE> came, this place has changed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸速い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hah, hah! Boss! I got the ice!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Ah, thank you, <STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So many customers you run out of ice..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"As long as <STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE> is around, I'll stay a regular here too."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Also, Yama-san, your lighter was about to run out, so I bought you one."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh!?
{PAUSE ""}
　Ah, sorry, <STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE>, but I've got a new lighter right here―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey! Yama-san!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Whoops! Thanks, <STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE>. You're so thoughtful."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Well, you know, <STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE> isn't so much the type with star quality as the type with <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="あいきょう">charm</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? Isn't <STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE> the type with star quality?
{PAUSE ""}
　Even in looks, compared to <STYLE ID="2">Momoko Goto</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">Nat-chan</STYLE> is more my type."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"And she forgives the sexual harassment."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Don't say that!"<BR>
